``` Classic SSH brute force: one source IP failing many attempts against
    one host in a tight window. Mirrors detection/ssh_bruteforce.py::detect_brute_force().
    Saved in the live instance as "Login Integrity - SSH Classic Brute Force". ```
index=login_integrity_ssh success=0
| bucket _time span=5m
| stats count as attempt_count by src_ip target_host _time
| where attempt_count>=10
| sort -attempt_count
